# Lab knowledge: vendor (synthetic).
HPLC Suite 1 | reports | Retention time | The HPLC Suite 1 controller streams retention time at 10 Hz.
HPLC Suite 1 | reports | Column pressure | The HPLC Suite 1 controller streams column pressure at 10 Hz.
HPLC Suite 1 | reports | Peak area | The HPLC Suite 1 controller streams peak area at 10 Hz.
Bioreactor B | reports | pH | The Bioreactor B controller streams ph at 10 Hz.
Bioreactor B | reports | Temperature | The Bioreactor B controller streams temperature at 10 Hz.
Bioreactor B | reports | Viscosity | The Bioreactor B controller streams viscosity at 10 Hz.
Bioreactor B | reports | Glucose feed rate | The Bioreactor B controller streams glucose feed rate at 10 Hz.
Robotic Arm 3 | reports | Torque | The Robotic Arm 3 controller streams torque at 10 Hz.
Robotic Arm 3 | reports | Cycle count | The Robotic Arm 3 controller streams cycle count at 10 Hz.
Feed Pump 2 | prone_to | Micro-cavitation | Vendor bulletin: Feed Pump 2 is prone to micro-cavitation when its inlet seal wears.
Micro-cavitation | causes | Glucose feed spike | Vendor bulletin: Micro-cavitation in a feed pump causes uneven, spiking glucose delivery.
Glucose feed spike | causes | Broth viscosity rise | Vendor bulletin: A glucose feed spike raises broth viscosity within minutes.
Broth viscosity rise | causes | Pipetting drag | Vendor bulletin: Viscous broth drags on the pipette head during aspiration.
Pipetting drag | causes | Torque drop | Vendor bulletin: Pipetting drag lowers the arm's measured joint torque.
Torque drop | triggers | E-14 | Vendor bulletin: A torque drop below 12 Nm triggers error E-14 on the robotic arms.
Gripper wear | causes | Torque drop | Vendor bulletin: gripper wear can reduce torque readings.
HPLC Column C18-7 | prone_to | Column fouling | Vendor bulletin: The C18-7 column fouls with host-cell protein over successive runs.
Column fouling | causes | Column pressure rise | Vendor bulletin: A fouling column raises back-pressure.
Column pressure rise | causes | Retention time drift | Vendor bulletin: Rising column pressure shifts retention time later.
